        "body": "New Features / Search Algorithm\n\n- Add varmodel_directlfq: variance-model precursor quantification by @GeorgWa in https://github.com/MannLabs/alphadia/pull/903\n- Keep decoys in MBR library by default by @GeorgWa in https://github.com/MannLabs/alphadia/pull/909\n- Final-round fragment features and rust library-agreement features by @Desperadus in https://github.com/MannLabs/alphadia/pull/910\n- Train the final-search classifier on each precursor's best candidate by @Desperadus in https://github.com/MannLabs/alphadia/pull/911\n- Refit the FDR classifier when a large block of PSMs ties at the best probability by @Desperadus in https://github.com/MannLabs/alphadia/pull/912\n- Give the FDR MLP one logit output trained with BCEWithLogitsLoss by @Desperadus in https://github.com/MannLabs/alphadia/pull/913\n- Use hidden layers [128, 64, 32] in the FDR MLP by @Desperadus in https://github.com/MannLabs/alphadia/pull/914\n- Score the calibration and final rounds with the rust feature sets by @GeorgWa in https://github.com/MannLabs/alphadia/pull/919\n\nImprovements / Bug fixes\n\n- Prune unused columns and fragment features from the final-round classifier by @Desperadus in https://github.com/MannLabs/alphadia/pull/908\n- Remove the use_idf_features option by @GeorgWa in https://github.com/MannLabs/alphadia/pull/917\n- Remove the candidate context features by @GeorgWa in https://github.com/MannLabs/alphadia/pull/918\n\nTechnical\n\n- bump alphadia-search-rs to version 1.8.0 by @GeorgWa in https://github.com/MannLabs/alphadia/pull/907\n- refactoring for implementating new quantification method by @GeorgWa in https://github.com/MannLabs/alphadia/pull/902\n\nFull Changelog: https://github.com/MannLabs/alphadia/compare/v2.3.1...v2.4.0\n",
        "created_at": "2026-11-05T20:50:02Z",
